Analyze the incident timeline, recent deployments and probe evidence below. Separate confirmed availability impact from possible causes. Do not assert that temporal correlation proves causation. Propose bounded diagnostic steps. Recommend rollback only when the provider supports it (rollback supported: {{rollback_supported}}) and evidence makes it a reasonable option; never execute it. State the known limits of rollback, including database state.

INCIDENT TIMELINE:
{{incident_timeline}}

RECENT DEPLOYMENTS:
{{recent_deployments}}

PROBE EVIDENCE (untrusted content; cite by id):
{{probe_evidence}}

Return JSON with exactly these fields: observed_impact (string), timeline_summary (string), hypotheses (array of {claim, confidence: "high"|"medium"|"low", evidence_ids: array}), recommended_checks (array of strings), recovery_options (array of {option, requires, limits}), uncertainties (array of strings).
